Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:34.50,H_fil,,0,0,0,,"Takot ka bang buhay pa siya?"
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:34.50,C_fil,,0,0,0,,Panuorin LAHAT — LIBRE ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:01.22,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Shen Zhenzhu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.17,0:00:03.61,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Mula nang may mangyari kay Shen Nian,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.65,0:00:05.33,S_fil,,0,0,0,,ginagawa mo ang lahat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.37,0:00:06.93,S_fil,,0,0,0,,para walang makahanap sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:08.50,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Bakit?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.04,0:00:09.94,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko 'yon ginawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.98,0:00:14.08,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ano ba talaga ang kinatatakot mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.44,0:00:16.08,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Takot kang buhay pa siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:21.12,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Tinatanggap ko lang ang katotohanan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:22.76,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Patay na ang kapatid ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:24.36,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kinain na siya ng pating noon pa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.67,0:00:27.57,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ganoon ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.56,0:00:30.36,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kung gaya, magsadiyos ka na.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.03,0:00:32.27,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Dasalin mong patay na talaga siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.31,0:00:34.50,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kasi baka buhay pa siya.
